:: Act3_7Eleven_Arrival {"position":"750,1850","size":"100,100"}
<<nobr>>
<<set $currentLocation to "seven_eleven">>
<<set $inSafehouse to false>>
<<set _arrivedLate to (visited("Act2_5_MarcusCabin"))>>
<</nobr>>

<h2>ROUTE 9 — 7-ELEVEN COMMERCIAL STRIP</h2>

<div style="margin-bottom: 15px; text-align: center;">
    <img src="image/Act3_Timberline/screening.gif" style="max-width: 100%; border: 1px solid #333; filter: hue-rotate(330deg) contrast(1.2);">
</div>

The tires of Reyes' pickup screech to a halt behind a rusted delivery van across from the 7-Eleven gas station.
<br><br>
Shattered glass glints in the flickering fluorescent canopy lights. Black smoke billows from an overturned sedan near the gas pumps.
<br><br>
Inside the convenience store, rapid gunshot flashes illuminate the shattered windows. You can hear the guttural shrieks of infected mixed with angry shouting from armed scavengers!

<br><br>
<<chat "Reyes" "image/avatars/reyes.gif" "right" "There's Miller's armored pickup truck smashed straight through the front entrance glass! Scavengers have them pinned against the beverage cooler at the back!">>

<br><br>
<<if _arrivedLate>>
    <span style="color:var(--accent-gold);">[DAYLIGHT ASSAULT]</span>
    Bright morning daylight illuminates the chaos, but infected are spilling out from the alleyways behind the strip mall!
<<else>>
    <span style="color:var(--accent-blue);">[PRE-DAWN ASSAULT]</span>
    Heavy mist and rain swirl under the flickering neon "7-ELEVEN" sign, casting eerie shadows across the parking lot.
<</if>>

<br><br>
<<chat "Reyes" "image/avatars/reyes.gif" "right" "We need to breach the store and relieve Miller's team before they get overwhelmed! How do you want to play this?">>

<br><br>
<div class="choice-menu">
    <button style="border-left-color: var(--accent-red) !important;">
        <<link "💥 Breach through the main shattered double doors [FRONT ASSAULT]" "Act3_7Eleven_Combat">>
            <<set $seven_eleven_approach to "front">>
            <<addTime 2>>
        <</link>>
        <span class="btn-sub"><b style="color:var(--accent-red);">[COMBAT ASSAULT]</b> Charge straight through the front entrance with Reyes, weapons hot.</span>
    </button>

    <<if $skills.stealth >= 2 or hasTrait("STEALTH") or hasTrait("SCAVENGER")>>
        <button style="border-left-color: var(--accent-gold) !important;">
            <<link "🥷 Flank around the rear dumpster to the storage room door [STEALTH]" "Act3_7Eleven_Flank">>
                <<set $seven_eleven_approach to "stealth">>
                <<addTime 3>>
            <</link>>
            <span class="btn-sub"><b style="color:var(--accent-gold);">[STEALTH / TRAIT CHECK]</b> Sneak around the back alley to catch the scavengers from behind.</span>
        </button>
    <<else>>
        <button disabled style="opacity: 0.4; cursor: not-allowed; border-color: #333;">
            <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">🥷 Flank around the rear dumpster [REQUIRES STEALTH 2]</span><br>
            <span class="btn-sub" style="color: #666;">You need higher stealth to maneuver around the alley silently.</span>
        </button>
    <</if>>
</div>
